[SIZE=5][B][COLOR=#FFAA00]★ Overview[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]
[B]ChatGames[/B] is a modern, lightweight chat puzzle and live server challenge engine built from scratch in Java 21 for server owners who want active, engaging chat competition with zero main-thread lag.

Featuring [B]12 interactive chat puzzles[/B] and [B]7 in-world action challenges[/B], ChatGames provides clickable chat buttons, hoverable secret tooltips, multi-winner podiums, structured prize pools with inventory overflow protection, asynchronous SQLite & MySQL persistence, Discord webhooks, and PlaceholderAPI support.

[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][B][COLOR=#FFAA00]★ 19 Game Categories[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]

[B][COLOR=#55FFFF]12 Chat Puzzles:[/COLOR][/B]
[LIST]
[*][B]Scramble ([FONT=Courier New]scramble[/FONT]):[/B] Unscramble mixed word and phrase anagrams.
[*][B]Reverse ([FONT=Courier New]reverse[/FONT]):[/B] Decode backwards text in chat.
[*][B]Type Race ([FONT=Courier New]type_race[/FONT]):[/B] Fast typing challenge where the quickest player wins.
[*][B]Number Guess ([FONT=Courier New]number_guess[/FONT]):[/B] Guess the secret number within a configured range.
[*][B]Memory List ([FONT=Courier New]memory_list[/FONT]):[/B] Memorize a sequence of items before chat clears, then recall them in order!
[*][B]Click Rush ([FONT=Courier New]click_rush[/FONT]):[/B] Interactive JSON chat button that rewards the fastest clicker.
[*][B]Missing Chars ([FONT=Courier New]missing_chars[/FONT]):[/B] Complete words with masked letters.
[*][B]Hover Reveal ([FONT=Courier New]hover_reveal[/FONT]):[/B] Hover your cursor over the chat badge to reveal the secret phrase.
[*][B]Cipher String ([FONT=Courier New]cipher_string[/FONT]):[/B] Fast typing test with generated alphanumeric, hex, or symbol codes.
[*][B]Arithmetic ([FONT=Courier New]arithmetic[/FONT]):[/B] Solve dynamic math equations (+, -, *, /) with scaling complexity.
[*][B]Algebra ([FONT=Courier New]algebra[/FONT]):[/B] Deduce the unknown glyph value from a 3-row system of symbol equations.
[*][B]Quiz ([FONT=Courier New]quiz[/FONT]):[/B] Server trivia questions supporting multiple valid answers.
[/LIST]

[B][COLOR=#55FF55]7 World Action Challenges:[/COLOR][/B]
[LIST]
[*][B]Slayer ([FONT=Courier New]slayer[/FONT]):[/B] First competitor to slay the target quota of a specific mob.
[*][B]Mining ([FONT=Courier New]mining[/FONT]):[/B] First competitor to mine the target quota of blocks.
[*][B]Building ([FONT=Courier New]building[/FONT]):[/B] First competitor to place the target quota of blocks.
[*][B]Angling ([FONT=Courier New]angling[/FONT]):[/B] First competitor to catch specific fish or treasure from water.
[*][B]Culinary ([FONT=Courier New]culinary[/FONT]):[/B] First competitor to consume required foods.
[*][B]Artisan ([FONT=Courier New]artisan[/FONT]):[/B] First competitor to craft target items (supports shift-crafting).
[*][B]Smelting ([FONT=Courier New]smelting[/FONT]):[/B] First competitor to smelt and extract items from a furnace.
[/LIST]

[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][B][COLOR=#FFAA00]★ Commands & Permissions[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]

[B]Primary Command:[/B] [FONT=Courier New]/chatgames[/FONT] (Aliases: [FONT=Courier New]/cg[/FONT], [FONT=Courier New]/cgames[/FONT], [FONT=Courier New]/chatgame[/FONT])

[TABLE]
[TR]
[TH]Command[/TH]
[TH]Permission[/TH]
[TH]Description[/TH]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD]/cg help[/TD]
[TD]chatgames.command.help[/TD]
[TD]Display the interactive command guide.[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD]/cg start <category|random> [args][/TD]
[TD]chatgames.command.start.*[/TD]
[TD]Launch a specific category or random round.[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD]/cg stop[/TD]
[TD]chatgames.command.stop[/TD]
[TD]Abort the currently active round.[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD]/cg top[/TD]
[TD]chatgames.command.leaderboard[/TD]
[TD]Display the top score leaderboard.[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD]/cg fastest[/TD]
[TD]chatgames.command.fastest[/TD]
[TD]Display the fastest reaction speed records.[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD]/cg score [player][/TD]
[TD]chatgames.command.score[/TD]
[TD]Inspect personal or another player's score.[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD]/cg score <add|take|set|reset> <player> [amt][/TD]
[TD]chatgames.command.score.manage[/TD]
[TD]Modify or reset competitor scores.[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD]/cg visibility [player][/TD]
[TD]chatgames.command.visibility[/TD]
[TD]Toggle round broadcast visibility.[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD]/cg audio [player][/TD]
[TD]chatgames.command.audio[/TD]
[TD]Toggle round sound cues.[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD]/cg scheduler[/TD]
[TD]chatgames.command.scheduler[/TD]
[TD]Pause or resume automatic rounds.[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD]/cg history [count][/TD]
[TD]chatgames.command.history[/TD]
[TD]View recent round audit logs.[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD]/cg reload[/TD]
[TD]chatgames.command.reload[/TD]
[TD]Reload all YAML configuration files.[/TD]
[/TR]
[/TABLE]
